licensed under the MIT License.

What was taken: the secret-redaction rules and the redact-and-cap capture routine
(src/host/redact.ts), the usage and cost key spellings for Langfuse
(src/host/present.ts), and the design of an isolated OpenTelemetry tracer
provider that is never installed globally (src/host/runtime.ts).

What was changed: the host integration is new. Spans come from DSH's durable
session event log and the llm/stream tap instead of pi hooks, and the redaction
rules were extended (vendor tokens, JWTs, PEM blocks, generic token/secret
values).

